@startuml 7-1
' --- 环境设置 ---
' skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "SimSun"
' 自动对步骤进行编号
autonumber

' --- 样式定义 ---
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2E4053
    LifeLineBorderColor #2E4053
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #E3F2FD
    ParticipantBorderColor #1976D2
    ActorBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
    GroupBackgroundColor #FBFCFC
}

title "作业OCR自动批改系统 - 完整业务流程时序图"

' --- 参与者定义 ---
actor "教师 (User)" as Teacher
participant "MainWindow\n(UI界面)" as UI #F1F8E9
participant "APIClient\n(前端请求)" as Client #F1F8E9
participant "Flask App\n(后端网关)" as Server #E3F2FD
participant "Core Modules\n(核心算法)" as Core #FFF3E0
database "Database\n(持久化存储)" as DB #D5F5E3

== 1. 图片上传阶段 ==

Teacher -> UI : 1. 选择作业图片
UI -> Client : 2. upload_image(path)
activate Client
Client -> Server : 3. POST /api/upload (Multipart)
activate Server
Server -> DB : 4. 存储图片信息 (Homework表)
Server --> Client : 5. 200 OK (file_id)
deactivate Server
Client --> UI : 6. 返回 file_id
deactivate Client
UI -> Teacher : 7. 预览图片显示成功

== 2. 核心批改阶段 ==

Teacher -> UI : 8. 输入标准答案，点击“开始批改”
UI -> Client : 9. grade(file_id, questions)
activate Client
Client -> Server : 10. POST /api/grade (JSON)
activate Server

group 核心批改流水线 [后端执行]
    Server -> Core : 11. preprocess(image_path)
    Core --> Server : 返回预处理数组
    Server -> Core : 12. recognize(image) [OCR识别]
    Core --> Server : 返回 OcrResult 列表
    Server -> Core : 13. parse_answers() [解析结构化]
    Core --> Server : 返回 {题号: 答案}
    Server -> Core : 14. grade_all() [比对评分]
    Core --> Server : 返回 GradingReport 报告
end

Server -> DB : 15. 持久化批改记录 (Record/Results表)
Server --> Client : 16. 200 OK (GradingReport JSON)
deactivate Server
Client --> UI : 17. 传递完整批改结果
deactivate Client
UI -> Teacher : 18. 在 ResultPanel 渲染分数与正误

== 3. 报告导出阶段 ==

Teacher -> UI : 19. 点击“导出 CSV/HTML”
UI -> Client : 20. export_report(file_id, fmt)
activate Client
Client -> Server : 21. POST /api/export
activate Server
Server -> Core : 22. 执行导出逻辑 (Exporter)
Core --> Server : 返回文件内容/流
Server --> Client : 23. 返回文件二进制数据
deactivate Server
Client --> UI : 24. 弹出文件保存对话框
deactivate Client
UI -> Teacher : 25. 提示保存成功

@enduml